\&New issue body
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-F, \-\-body\-file <string>\fR
\&Read the new issue body from a file
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-assignee\fR
\&Clear the issue assignee
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-t, \-\-title <string>\fR
\&New issue title
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
\&Skip confirmation prompt
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
